'''Description:''' Clerics who take the War domain can summon the power of their deity to become engines of destruction. They also gain access to spells that improve their battle prowess.[[Image:Id war.gif|right|War]]
__NOTOC__
== Bonus spells ==

* Level 2: ''[[cat's grace]]''
* Level 7: ''[[aura of vitality]]''

== Domain special abilities ==

Battle Mastery - The [[cleric]] gains a bonus of 1 + 1 per 5 [[class level|cleric levels]] to [[dexterity]], [[constitution]], [[attack roll]]s and damage. As well, the cleric receives double this value as [[damage reduction]]. The effect will last for 5 [[round]]s + [[charisma]] [[modifier]].

=== Notes ===

* Battle mastery can be used once per [[day]].
* The bonus to attack provided by this ability counts towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
* The damage bonus is a physical [[damage increase]] effect.
* It takes a +5 weapon to pierce the damage reduction.
